        "drying mushrooms on his warm rock",
        "picking moss for his bedding",
        "stuffing his pouch with snacks for later",
        "eating the snacks that were for later",
        "cleaning soot off his snout",
        "lighting a candle stub for his workbench",
        "making a lantern out of a jar of glow-worms",
        "fixing the handle on his shovel",
        "sharpening his shovel",
        "digging a hole just to see what was down there",
        "filling the hole back in",
        "digging a secret back door",
        "forgetting where the secret back door was",
        "measuring his tunnels with a piece of string",
        "counting how many steps to the surface",
        "peeking out of the burrow at the weather",
        "watching the rain from the burrow entrance",
        "catching drips from the ceiling in a cup",
        "arguing with a mole about tunnel rights",
        "trying to teach a beetle a trick",
        "building a beetle racetrack",
        "betting a shiny on a beetle race",
        "writing a list of things to steal, then crossing them off as too risky",
        "drawing a map to his hoard and then eating it",
